  "title": "The Tusken Clan Laid to Rest",
  "description": "Returning to the Tusken Raider encampment Boba Fett sees smoke in the distance. The entire settlement has been wiped out, with all of the tribe killed. Scrawled on the remnants of a Tusken domicile is the insignia of the Kintan Striders Gang. Stricken by sadness, Fett gathers up his fallen brethren and gives them a proper farewell, igniting an immense funeral pyre. With a heavy heart, Boba leads his bantha away, moving on from another chapter of his life."
